                        <div class="entry-content clearfix pb-40">
                            <header class="text-center pt-10"> <span class="entry-categories-2"><a href="https://ucsiuniversity073.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GCA/EofvSN-iaylBiimFXpFtyxsBDvlLR9-KFRjE6i4ycVlS1Q?e=0Wyvfu" target="_blank">UCSI strengthens ties with UGC Bangladesh</a></span> </header>
                            <div class="qna">
                                <div class="question"><span></span></div>
                                <div class="answer" style="height: 0px;">
                                    <p>UCSI University recently hosted a distinguished delegation from the Bangladesh University Grants Commission (UGC) at our main campus in Kuala Lumpur.</p>
                                    <p>Led by the Bangladesh UGC chairman Prof Dr Syed Muhammed Abul Faiz, the visit strengthened our international educational partnerships.</p>
                                    <p>We discussed higher education in both countries, explored opportunities for Bangladeshi students in Malaysia and reaffirmed our commitment to maintaining Malaysian education standards at our Bangladesh branch campus.</p>
                                    <p>We extend our gratitude to all our esteemed guests, including UGC members Prof Dr Mohammad Anwar Hossain, Dr Fakhrul Islam and others.</p>
                                    <p>This visit marks an exciting step towards cross-border education. We remain dedicated to providing world-class learning experiences for students globally.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
