                        <div class="entry-thumb"> <a href="https://ucsiuniversity073.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GCA/EnAWCB52KV5MqqTm10HQnzQBb7-bHLjJBSZLn-2S0YWJEg?e=pT3gLO" target="_blank"> <img typeof="foaf:Image" src="https://www.ucsiuniversity.edu.my/sites/default/files/styles/photo_gallery__398x266_/public/ucs01237_1.jpg?itok=hpSiKJwK" width="398" height="266" alt="UCSI University Welcomes Jordanian Academic Delegation" title="UCSI University Welcomes Jordanian Academic Delegation"> </a></div>
                        <div class="entry-content clearfix pb-40">
                            <header class="text-center pt-10"> <span class="entry-categories-2"><a href="https://ucsiuniversity073.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GCA/EnAWCB52KV5MqqTm10HQnzQBb7-bHLjJBSZLn-2S0YWJEg?e=pT3gLO" target="_blank">UCSI University Welcomes Jordanian Academic Delegation</a></span> </header>
                            <div class="qna">
                                <div class="question"><span></span></div>
                                <div class="answer" style="height: 0px;">
                                    <p>On Nov 28, 2024, UCSI University was honoured to host a distinguished delegation comprising representatives from 15 Jordanian universities and editors at our Kuala Lumpur campus.</p>
                                    <p>Organised by Education Malaysia Global Services (EMGS), the visit served as a platform to explore potential collaborations, strengthening ties between Malaysia and Jordan in the field of higher education.</p>
                                    <p>The delegation participated in networking sessions, engaging discussions and a campus tour that showcased UCSI’s state-of-the-art facilities and vibrant student environment. These interactions laid the foundation for academic partnerships and opportunities for Jordanian students to pursue world-class education in Malaysia.</p>
                                    <p>We extend our gratitude to EMGS and our Jordanian counterparts for making this visit a success. UCSI remains committed to fostering global partnerships and delivering exceptional learning experiences that transcend borders.&nbsp;</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
            </span>
        </div>
