                        <div class="entry-content clearfix pb-40">
                            <header class="text-center pt-10"> <span class="entry-categories-2"><a href="https://ucsiuniversity073.sharepoint.com/:f:/s/GCA/Eu7N6pC4rfJLkqTo81k2o0kBsWDo6NjOcytn5zbZnGyxFg?e=2uQapO" target="_blank">UCSI University celebrates the 50th anniversary of diplomatic relations between China and Malaysia</a></span> </header>
                            <div class="qna">
                                <div class="question"><span></span></div>
                                <div class="answer" style="height: 0px;">
                                    <p>UCSI University's Institute of Creative Arts and Design (ICAD) commemorated the 50th anniversary of diplomatic relations between China and Malaysia with an International Poster Exhibition focused on Asian urban culture. The exhibition highlighted the unique cultures and traditions of various cities. Key events of the week included an academic forum and a film screening, both aimed at fostering stronger ties and promoting cross-cultural understanding.</p>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                </div>
